       ],
       "do": "Recall the usual adult ranges for electrolytes, blood counts, renal tests and ABGs.",
       "ek": [
        "K 3.5–5.0, Na 135–145, Ca 9.0–10.5, Mg 1.3–2.1; pH 7.35–7.45, PaCO₂ 35–45, HCO₃⁻ 22–26."
